# React Renderer + UI

## Structure

- Functional components; pages are default exports named `*Page`
- **HashRouter** only (`main.tsx`) — required for Electron file URLs
- Add routes under the shell layout in `App.tsx`

## State

- Global: `useApp()` from `context/AppContext.tsx` — settings, readiness, job state
- Do not duplicate job IPC listeners in pages; context owns subscriptions
- Local form state stays in the page component

## Page layout pattern

```
PageHeader (title, subtitle, actions)
  → Panel / SectionLabel sections
  → form fields (local state)
  → LogConsole (job output)
```

Reuse primitives from `components/ui.tsx`: `PageHeader`, `Panel`, `Button`, `Field`, `SectionLabel`, etc.

## Styling

- CSS variables (`--bg`, `--accent`, `--text`, …) + Tailwind utilities
- Icons from `lucide-react` only — avoid new UI libraries

## Normal-user UX

- Status panel shows plain-English headline and hints
- Raw logs collapsed under **Technical details** by default
- Extend `logFormat.ts` and `LogConsole.tsx` — not page-local log rendering
- Cancel button label: **Stop**
- Disable run buttons when `job.active`

## Job pages

- Backup, Restore, Migrate each call `window.api.runJob(input)` with typed `JobInput`
- Persist non-secret prefs via `updateSettings()` after successful form changes
- Use `Pickers.tsx` for directory selection
